    {
      "id": "first-graph-question",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Which venue should we use?",
      "position": {
        "x": -100,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 700,
      "height": 390,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-first-graph"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Which venue should we use for a workshop?\n\nWe need room for 12 people and a quiet place to talk.\n\n**This is a fictional example.** The venue notes below are invented to show how a graph works.\n\nRead **Venue notes → Decision → Next step**. A card holds a piece of the work. A labeled line tells you how two pieces relate.\n\n**Try it:** if the library room became unavailable, which decision and next step would need reviewing?\n\n[Make a graph about your own question](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/bootstrap-llm/root.node) · [Back to Start Here](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/start-here/root.node)\n"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "first-graph-evidence",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Venue notes",
      "position": {
        "x": -200,
        "y": 620
      },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-first-graph"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Venue notes\n\n**Fictional source: planning call notes**\n\n- Library room: seats 16; enclosed and quiet.\n- Café table: seats 8; shared public space.\n- Availability has not been checked.\n\nThese notes support a choice. They do not confirm a booking.\n"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "first-graph-decision",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Decision",
      "position": {
        "x": 400,
        "y": 620
      },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-first-graph"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Decision\n\n**Try the library room first.**\n\nIt fits 12 people and offers a quieter setting than the café.\n\nThis decision depends on the venue notes. If those facts change, revisit the choice.\n"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "first-graph-next-step",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Next step",
      "position": {
        "x": 1000,
        "y": 620
      },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-first-graph"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Next step\n\n**Ask the library about availability.**\n\nConfirm a date, access arrangements, and any cost before booking.\n\nIf the room is unavailable, return to the decision and consider another venue.\n"
        }
      }
    }
